    "reference": "ch04.pptx (slide 17) · CIS 4100 Ch 4 Assignment Eric Juarez.docx (question 4.4) · CIS 4100 Chapters 1-4 Study Guide.md (Chapter 4 — Data formats) · CIS 4100 In Depth Study Guide Chapters 1-4.docx (Chapter 4 — Data formats)"
